  "body": "Found while using `no_implicit_optional`:\r\n\r\n```\r\nsynapse/handlers/events.py:90: error: Argument \"explicit_room_id\" to \"get_events_for\" of \"Notifier\" has incompatible type \"Optional[str]\"; expected \"str\"  [arg-type]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is the full snippet:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/fc8b3d88097d2c985e8eae9779cdb4b23e1a8ef6/synapse/handlers/events.py#L49-L91\r\n\r\n`room_id` is still `Optional[str]` when given to `self.notifier.get_events_for` as named argument `explicit_room_id`",
